93: ## 2. Logic Chain
94: 
95: ```
96: [Observation 1.1: SyntaxError on ?., ??, and 300_000]
97:   │
98:   ├─► Step 1: V8 7.8 Syntax Compliance
99:   │   Because V8 parses JavaScript files prior to execution, modern ES2020 syntax causes fatal
100:   │   module evaluation errors. Replacing ?. with classical boolean guards (&&) and ?? with
101:   │   safe ternary expressions eliminates all parse-time failures.
102:   │
103: [Observation 1.1: fetch, AbortController, Readable.fromWeb are undefined]
104:   │
105:   ├─► Step 2: Native Node 12 HTTP/HTTPS Client & Stream Direct Piping
106:   │   - By building http-client.js using native http.request / https.request, we maintain zero
107:   │     external npm dependencies and achieve full redirect following and timeout handling.
108:   │   - In Node 18, Readable.fromWeb was only needed to convert WHATWG streams to Node streams.
109:   │     In Node 12, http.IncomingMessage is ALREADY a native stream.Readable, allowing direct
110:   │     zero-buffering pipeline(upstreamRes, res) transfer from network socket to client socket.
111:   │   - AbortController is replaced with req.on('close') + upstreamReq.destroy().
112:   │
113: [Observation 1.1 & 1.3: WebAssembly and crypto.createDecipheriv succeed on TV]
114:   │
115:   ├─► Step 3: Stream Resolution Without Regressions
116:   │   - WebAssembly.compile and instantiate compile crush.wasm in <1ms and allocate 1.06 MB RAM.
117:   │   - Native crypto.createDecipheriv('aes-256-gcm', responseKey, iv) with setAAD and setAuthTag
118:   │     decrypts the gateway response into JSON containing the master playlist URL.
119:   │
120: [Observation 1.2: 5s idle timeout calling process.exit(0)]
121:   │
122:   ├─► Step 4: Triple-Shield Service Persistence
123:   │   To ensure the embedded HTTP streaming proxy never terminates while the TV app is running:
124:   │   - Shield 1: Disable activityManager.exitOnTimeout (exitOnTimeout = false).
125:   │   - Shield 2: Create a permanent internal activity via _createInternal('cinejoy_proxy_keepalive').
126:   │   - Shield 3: Register a Luna keepalive subscription method for the frontend webOS app.
127: ```
